Build the LP layer without CPLEX.

OsiIPCpxSolverInterface guards on USE_LP alone, so enabling any LP solver pulls
in CPLEX headers, and resource_detection hard-codes CPLEX rather than reading
the lpsolver option. Both are fixed here to let the detector run on COIN's Clp.

